  "body": "Some homes just have that special something, and this is one you'll want to hold onto!\r\n\r\nTucked away in the coastal community of Gulf Harbour, this welcoming BRICK and Weatherboard home brings together generous living spaces, easy indoor-outdoor flow and a relaxed lifestyle that's hard to resist.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is its spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, thoughtfully designed to bring everyone together while offering plenty of room to spread out and relax. Flowing effortlessly out to the courtyard, garden and deck, this inviting space creates a wonderful connection between indoors and out. Whether you're hosting summer barbecues, entertaining friends, enjoying family gatherings or simply soaking up the sunshine, it's a setting made for easy everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom offers a wonderful retreat of its own, complete with a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and a generous private balcony. A lovely space to start your morning with a coffee, enjoy a some fresh air or simply escape for a quiet moment at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nWith three bedrooms and two bathrooms, the home provides flexibility for families, couples, downsizers or anyone looking for a comfortable place to call their own.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location!\r\n\r\nGulf Harbour is one of the Hibiscus Coast's distinctive coastal communities, where your days off work can be spent exploring the beautiful beaches, enjoying the marina atmosphere or discovering the walking tracks and spectacular scenery of nearby Shakespear Regional Park.\r\n\r\nThe Gulf Harbour Marina offer a wonderful mix of waterfront cafes, restaurants and everyday conveniences, while excellent school like Gulf Harbour School and Wentworth Primary and College are nearby. For those commuting to the city, the Gulf Harbour ferry provides an alternative to sitting in motorway traffic.\r\n\r\nFrom morning walks along the coast to afternoon coffees by the marina and evenings entertaining at home, this is a location where the lifestyle is every bit as appealing as the property itself.\r\n\r\nCome along to our next open home or contact us to arrange a private viewing.",
